@IntegrationOps.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7004

### Process liveness
GET {{IntegrationOps.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: text/plain

### List run snapshots
GET {{IntegrationOps.Api_HostAddress}}/api/integration-runs
Accept: application/json

### Database readiness
GET {{IntegrationOps.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: text/plain

### Explicit synthetic intake: reuse this key/body for a replay, change the key for a new run.
POST {{IntegrationOps.Api_HostAddress}}/api/integration-runs
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: synthetic-example-0001

{"partner":"Synthetic Intake Example","operation":"Example import"}

### Use the Location returned by POST for the actual generated ID.
GET {{IntegrationOps.Api_HostAddress}}/api/integration-runs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
